  "title": "Notice of 2026 Annual Meeting of Shareholders",
  "summary": "The 2026 Annual Meeting of Shareholders of SIFCO Industries, Inc. will be held virtually on January 28, 2026 at 9:30 AM Eastern Standard Time. Shareholders will be able to participate in the Annual Meeting online, vote their shares electronically, and submit questions at the meeting by registering at https://web.viewproxy.com/SIFCO/2026 no later than January 27,",
